{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53848","headline":"及第日报破东平 · 章孝标","name":"及第日报破东平","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十仙人谁得听，含元殿角管弦声。\n（见《日本古典文学大系》七三册日人藤原公任一○一八年顷纂《倭汉朗咏集》卷下《禁中》）（按：题据川口久雄校注引家藏私注本补。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}